[[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Make sure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position; then disconnect the battery negative (-) terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Drain the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429086\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428983\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429110\">2110A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428866\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429008\">1020B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. At the bench, undo the bolts (1a) and separate the engine oil\ninlet duct (1b) complete with gasket (1c) from the timing cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052729.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the engine oil inlet duct, complete\nwith gasket, back in its housing on the timing cover and secure\nit using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429008\">1020B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428866\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429110\">2110A60</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428983\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429086\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428822\">0010T11</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428824\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Fill the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428833\">0010T84</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          \n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]